WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:14.740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.499
I have already
isolated the infected systems

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.419
and the intranet server IPs.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.660
You all keep following up.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.779
Okay.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:21.899
(Qingniao Group)

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:22.680
Boss,

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.220
we just confirmed with Lawyer Fang.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.819
It is indeed as you expected,

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.700
malicious harassment
from Raymond's team.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.300
Rachel and her team will be stuck at
the airport for at least three more days.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.099
Since Rachel's team
can't get here in time,

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.140
have you found a backup team?

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.299
We've already contacted

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.339
other team leaders in the industry.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.300
But according to them,

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.899
Raymond Group is offering them

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.340
much better packages to join them.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.300
Can't sleep?

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:17.340
No.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.340
I wanted to ask

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.300
how things are over there.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.299
Tied down by some technical issues,

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.860
but they're being resolved.

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.340
Well, no matter how busy you are,
remember to eat.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:37.740
I don't want a husband
with stomach problems.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.780
Okay.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.139
Even if your soup keeps me healthy,

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.740
I'll be extra careful this time.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.660
Get some rest early.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.500
Take good care of yourself in Shen City.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:56.620
You too.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.300
I'm going to sleep now. Goodnight.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.740
Good night.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:36.160
=Echoes of Gang City=

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:41.880
=Episode 23=
(Xu Wanxin's Reinforcement)

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.940
Mr. Raymond,

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.820
this move in the game

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.140
was played beautifully.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:53.460
For now, you've completely
cut off Qingniao's lifeline.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.860
Qingniao Group wanted to use quantum
algorithms to iterate the market,

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.540
relying on core technology
to break the market balance.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.180
It was a death wish.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.140
I guess, in less than two days,

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.780
we'll be able to devour
Qingniao Group's market share.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.420
Good.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.219
Once we've taken Shen Gu down,

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.980
we'll resume
the acquisition plan for Minghui.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.140
Minghui has been doing basic
research on computing power.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.340
Once we fully acquire them,

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.980
they should soon be at our service.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.620
That includes Xu Wanxin.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.780
I don't smoke.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.980
I look forward to that day.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.140
Alright.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.780
Let's drink. Come.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.940
It's normal for everyone
to feel it's risky at this stage.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.980
If Raymond can unite nine
companies to suppress Yinghai,

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.819
so can we.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:01.980
But

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.140
we need everyone to see our strength.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.460
I've already prepared the funding.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.099
I will

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.620
get the word out as soon as possible.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.419
The more it's discussed,

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.740
the greater the impact.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.580
Xi,

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.540
I'm going to resign.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.140
Generating buzz through resignation

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.020
to expand our influence

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.340
is the fastest way.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.740
I know

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.740
you should have gone
back to lead Minghui long ago.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.940
But it still feels a bit sudden.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.460
Whatever decision you make,

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.740
I fully support you.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.340
Okay.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:55.980
Let's do it.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.060
Then, let's do it.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.340
Then, let's do it.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:07.780
Grandfather,

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.740
why aren't you resting yet?
It's so late.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.620
With so many things
happening at your company,

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.020
how could I sleep?

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.540
It's late.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.259
Get some rest early.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.859
I'll discuss it with you tomorrow

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.140
about you stepping in.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.020
Then, let's discuss it now. Sit.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.960
(Gang City Financial News)

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:49.939
Good morning, viewers.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.139
Today is Tuesday, June 3,

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.539
(Gang City Financial News)
the eighth day of the fifth lunar month.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.469
Welcome to the morning
financial news program.

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.060
I am Xu Wanxin.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:12.440
(Gang City Financial News)

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.899
According to our latest reports,

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:54.619
Yinghai Group, a global high-performance
computing equipment company,

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:57.059
has imposed technical
barriers against Qingniao Group.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.859
This incident will cause

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:02.419
sustained turmoil in the cutting-edge
computing power industry chain.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:06.460
That is all for today's financial news.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.660
Today

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.940
marks my 2,823rd day at
Gang City Financial News,

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.180
and it is also the last time

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.099
I will see you all as
a financial news anchor.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.260
Thank you for your support and company.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.699
At 2:00 PM today,

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.829
on the official Minghui Group account,

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:29.059
I'll be livestreaming my
resignation announcement.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.940
Please stay tuned.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.380
Follow me,

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.740
and follow Gang City Financial News.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.540
The world of business is vast.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.380
We

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.980
shall meet again.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.539
Ms. Xu, thank you
for your support and for being

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.220
with our TV station
for the past eight years.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.140
Gang City Financial News

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.340
will always be your home.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.299
Let's take a photo together.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.379
- Okay.
- Come on, hurry.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.580
Photo time.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.619
Come on, stand properly.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:29.659
Alright. Three, two, one.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:34.180
Gang City Financial News,
may your ratings soar!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.740
Mr. Gu, there's abnormal
access to the database.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.980
Freeze their suspicious accounts.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.460
Qi Feng,

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.939
we've found the attackers.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:01.140
Lock them down.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.100
They won't get away now.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:11.899
Hello, everyone.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:15.069
This is a special live broadcast
from Gang City Financial News.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.780
I'm Xueli, field reporter.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.099
According to the latest news,

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.819
Ms. Xu Wanxin,
our station's chief financial anchor,

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.939
submitted her resignation this morning.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:23.939
At 2:00 PM,

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:27.059
Ms. Xu will be at Minghui Group
to make her declaration.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.419
Through the Qingniao platform,

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.739
she'll live-stream this
major turning point in her career.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:34.539
Information about your resignation
is already in the top three trends.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.259
The number of live viewers has
broken the platform's peak record.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.339
Good. That's exactly what we wanted.

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:39.699
Good luck.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.339
Come on, Wanxin.

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.820
Everything is ready. Come.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:47.740
Are you ready?

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:48.859
Three,

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:49.259
two,

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:49.940
one.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:50.619
Start.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.740
(Minghui Group)
Viewers, colleagues, and friends,

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.060
hello,

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:56.940
I am Xu Wanxin.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:58.620
Many people ask me

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:02.540
why I'm choosing to leave
the TV station at this time.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.980
The answer is simple.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:06.460
In life,

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:10.219
one needs a strategic
transition at the right moment.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.619
As the third-generation
heir of the Minghui family,

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.860
I will officially take over our
century-old family business.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.620
This is a responsibility,

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.140
and even more so, a new beginning.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.819
Today, I officially announce

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.299
that the Chen and Song Groups

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:24.939
have officially become

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.660
partners with the Minghui Group
and Qingniao Group.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.219
Boss,

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:32.340
take a break.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.140
No need.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.019
We've already intercepted 60 percent

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.740
of the Raymond Group's
infiltration attacks.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.620
The security team is
checking suspicious IPs one by one.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:42.780
Understood.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.180
Boss,

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.260
Miss Xu...

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:46.659
Currently,

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.899
the core technology
development of Minghui Group

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.420
has reached a critical point.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.980
We will make some
research results public

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.140
while also

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.140
assisting Qingniao Group with
their technical breakthroughs.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.140
The current predicament
of Qingniao Group

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.540
is obvious.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.860
This could very well
become everyone's predicament.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.620
Minghui Group and
Qingniao Group both believe

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.740
that only by keeping core
technology in our own hands

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.020
(Minghui Group)
and breaking through technical barriers

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.140
can a company truly

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.380
become invincible.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:23.740
On behalf of Minghui Group,

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.020
I would like to invite
all partners to collaborate,

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.219
and I also hope

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.940
that more technical talent can join us.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.739
Your joining

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:35.180
is of immense value and significance

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.660
to Minghui and Qingniao
at this very moment.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:40.980
Thank you, everyone.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.619
Change our destination.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:48.739
Take me to Minghui Group.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:49.860
Yes, boss.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:57.980
Hello?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.820
Did you see Wanxin's
livestream just now?

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:07.580
Xu Wanxin posted a new
update on the Qingniao social platform.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.520
(Xu Wanxin)

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.420
Given the speed it's spreading,

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.540
someone must be backing them.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.740
We absolutely cannot let Shen Gu

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.140
use Xu Wanxin's
momentum to make a comeback.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.540
Issue an official letter
through Junlin Group.

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:30.140
Offer shares as a recruitment condition

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.260
to steal technical talent from Shen Gu.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.340
No, Dad. Since I...

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.860
Boss, I'm sorry.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:46.779
The firewall system
Shen Gu and his team have

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.700
is just too powerful.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.459
Our team can't handle them.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:52.740
I'll pay you more.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:56.460
Find someone who can break
Qingniao's system as soon as possible.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.939
If such a person truly existed,

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.580
you wouldn't be looking for us, right?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.220
I'll go put pressure on Yinghai

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.740
to have the legal
department keep stalling.

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.580
I don't believe

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:20.940
we can't crush Shen Gu and his team.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.120
(Spark, Minghui Group, Qingniao Group)

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:05.400
♪Tonight the rain falls soft and slow♪

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:12.480
♪Blending with letters left unread
drifting through the air♪

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:18.560
♪You turn and look back at me♪

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:25.200
♪In those same eyes familiar tears
quietly appear♪

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:31.680
♪It feels like we have carried so much♪

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:38.440
♪So many questions time itself
could not make clear♪

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:44.880
♪The moment you walked into my life♪

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:51.840
♪Every dream I had became something
I want with you near♪

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:59.200
♪How many letters have I written
just for you?♪

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:05.000
♪If only you could truly hear
what my heart is trying to say♪

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:12.039
♪From this life on
no distance could keep us apart♪

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.919
♪The promise we made♪

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:18.599
♪Will find its way to be fulfilled
one day♪

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:25.199
♪But I want more
than just that fleeting gaze♪

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:31.600
♪Still I have not heard your answer♪

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:38.319
♪Can we still rewrite the ending
we face?♪

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:43.440
♪When regrets begin to turn around you
will hear it all♪

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.920
♪Everything that leads me back to you♪